>Pushes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Immunity Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"paraimmune\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Paralysable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221114131607&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Armenius_Creature_d4fecc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Armenius.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>You know what, I changed my mind. BRING IT!</li><li>You little fool will see what you get for messing with us.</li><li>Not even Julius will be able to stop us!</li><li>BLOOD!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You get teleported out of Armenius room once you kill it, so you can't loot it. However, it doesn't drop any item.\nWhen visiting <a href=\"#/wiki/Armenius\">Armenius</a> bar you have a small chance of being challenged by him and teleported to his basement, if you do you get the achievement \"<a href=\"#/wiki/His%20True%20Face\">His True Face</a>\".\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"277e2be4a0aa52ebef734c1f8d06bbf7\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:129px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Armenius_True_Face-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:127px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"A player facing Armenius' true face on his basement.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"A player facing Armenius' true face on his basement.\" height=\"127\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Armenius_True_Face_6f0b2b.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Armenius True Face.png (411 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">A player facing Armenius' true face on his basement.</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"abili